loop/items/AI4DEV-5/gate1-critique.txt:7:   All four verification invocations resolve through mutable scripts in 
[package.json](/C:/Users/nirdr/Downloads/ai4good/.claude/worktrees/agent-a180654671adb8ac4/package.json:12). A PR changing only `src/**` plus 
those script bodies can replace `typecheck`, `at:selftest`, `at:check`, and `at:verify` with successful no-ops. `package.json` is outside both 
guard regexes, so the PR is classified Lovable-only; script-only changes are not represented in 
[bun.lock](/C:/Users/nirdr/Downloads/ai4good/.claude/worktrees/agent-a180654671adb8ac4/bun.lock:1), so the frozen install still succeeds. Bun 
explicitly executes named `package.json` scripts for `bun run`. [Bun run documentation](https://bun.sh/docs/runtime)
