loop/items/AI4DEV-5/gate2-critique-kimi.txt:34:  **Amendment trace (A1–A4, all verified applied, none missing or twisted):** A1 — the 
manifest-coverage check exists at ci.yml:126-142 and was executed live: a fabricated `tests/at/suites/req-999/` with no manifest is detected 
(`uncovered: 1 req-999`) and would fail the step; a fabricated manifest `req-777.json` with no suite is left for `at:verify` to refuse (exit 
2, confirmed in `runner.ts:981-982`). A2 — group is `...${{ github.event.pull_request.number || github.run_id }}` (ci.yml:30), so push runs 
share no group and the F4 middle-commit verdict loss is closed. A3 — one TSV line per file entry via `--jq '.[] | [.filename, 
(.previous_filename // "")] | @tsv'` (ci.yml:161-162); executed against 12 constructed PR file lists: both-territory PRs fail, `src→tests` and 
